### ===================================================================
### SUÍTE DE TESTES DE INTEGRAÇÃO - FLOWPAY MVP
### ===================================================================

### 0. Healthcheck & Swagger URL (Esperado: HTTP 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/
Accept: application/json

###

### 1. Happy Path: Atendente Livre (Esperado: HTTP 201 CREATED)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatRef": "whatsapp_555199999911",
  "subject": "Preciso de ajuda com limite do meu cartão de crédito"
}

###

### 2. Teste de Assunto / Strategy Pattern (Esperado: HTTP 201 CREATED em LOANS)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatRef": "telegram_99887766",
  "subject": "Gostaria de simular uma taxa de empréstimo"
}

###

### 3. Teste de Transbordo para Fila (Esperado: HTTP 202 ACCEPTED)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatRef": "whatsapp_555199999922",
  "subject": "Dúvida sobre fatura do cartão"
}

###

### 4. Finalizar Atendimento (Esperado: HTTP 200 OK)
# Copie e cole o ID de um ticket IN_PROGRESS retornado nos testes acima
PATCH http://localhost:8080/v1/tickets/REPLACE_WITH_TICKET_ID/finish
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. Bad Request / Validação DTO (Esperado: HTTP 400 BAD REQUEST)
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chatRef": "",
  "subject": ""
}

###

### 6. Consultar Estado Consolidado das Filas (Esperado: HTTP 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/queues/status
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Rota Inexistente / Fallback 404 (Esperado: HTTP 404 NOT FOUND)
GET http://localhost:8080/rota-que-nao-existe
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Analytics Mensal (Esperado: HTTP 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/analytics/monthly
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. Analytics Overview Global (Esperado: HTTP 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/analytics/overview
Accept: application/json